{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hide from Papaku</strong> is a horror-survival game that traps you in a house where every second counts. Stuck in a nightmare, your goal is simple yet challenging: solve puzzles, find essential items, and escape before Papaku finds you. Each room holds secrets, and every sound could draw Papaku's attentiona relentless pursuer who never gives up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With four levels of difficulty, <i>Hide from Papaku</i> offers challenges for everyone, from beginners to the fearless, and promises an intense experience where fear is constant and strategy is key. Face your worst nightmares and test your courage in a battle for survival!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517170?t=1743688440","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517170/ee4200ca4ab4235a79d70953038eba42558cd0c6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743688440","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517170/385de9f790a447613f442fa18a41221d6c069175/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743688440","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517170/385de9f790a447613f442fa18a41221d6c069175/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743688440","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hide from Papaku</strong> is a horror-survival game that traps you in a house where every second counts. Stuck in a nightmare, your goal is simple yet challenging: solve puzzles, find essential items, and escape before Papaku finds you. Each room holds secrets, and every sound could draw Papaku's attentiona relentless pursuer who never gives up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With four levels of difficulty, <i>Hide from Papaku</i> offers challenges for everyone, from beginners to the fea